  "reviews": {
    "original": {
      "analysis": "No conversion or loading defect was identified within the recorded checks: all 255 FP32 tensors have exact byte/dtype/shape equality, tied aliases are equal, metadata semantics and preserved tokenizer/template hashes match, and package/data/launcher/harness records match. Native reload used selected step 20; export used the explicit trained export with resume disabled. Both have 64 completed cases and rewards, val_only=true and no new checkpoint files. Resolved configurations differ only in artifact/template paths, run identity, dynamic local port and intended checkpoint resume versus export loading. Native scored 35/64 and export 34/64; retain all 15 raw-answer differences and the one formatting-sensitive loss on svamp__chal-520. The extractor selects a quoted placeholder in the export output. This explains grading, not the changed wording. Numerical execution or sampling may differ, but the cause is not established; this review does not claim deterministic generation equivalence or retroactive historical identity. No scorer change, rescoring or preferred-score rerun.",
